    "PS decode/NMS, frame, temporary and DDR peak values remain pending until implementation layout, buffer schedule and appropriate synthesis/board or runtime measurements exist.",
    "No precision, mAP, throughput, latency, Vivado resource, timing, board capacity or Stage 1 acceptance conclusion is produced by this report."
  ]
}